{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22033","main_id":22033,"main_title":"家乡之味","main_description":"来自璃月的学者汤雯似乎饱受思乡之情的困扰…","chapter_title":"家乡之味","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2203301,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2203301,"sequence":15,"variant":0,"line_id":220330106,"next_line_ids":[220330107],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3022,"speaker_text_hash":727626069,"speaker":"汤雯","speaker_raw":"汤雯","text_hash":2887090850,"text":"先自我介绍一下，我叫汤雯，是来自璃月的历史学者，之前正在实地调研稻妻的特色风俗与民话。","raw_text":"先自我介绍一下，我叫汤雯，是来自璃月的历史学者，之前正在实地调研稻妻的特色风俗与民话。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2203301.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22033","main_id":22033,"main_title":"家乡之味","main_description":"来自璃月的学者汤雯似乎饱受思乡之情的困扰…","chapter_title":"家乡之味","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2203301,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2203301,"sequence":16,"variant":0,"line_id":220330107,"next_line_ids":[220330108],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3022,"speaker_text_hash":727626069,"speaker":"汤雯","speaker_raw":"汤雯","text_hash":1100104426,"text":"本来资料已经搜集的差不多了，正准备返回璃月。但是因为稻妻的锁国令结被迫滞留在这里，已经有一段时间了…","raw_text":"本来资料已经搜集的差不多了，正准备返回璃月。但是因为稻妻的锁国令结被迫滞留在这里，已经有一段时间了…","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2203301.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22033","main_id":22033,"main_title":"家乡之味","main_description":"来自璃月的学者汤雯似乎饱受思乡之情的困扰…","chapter_title":"家乡之味","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2203301,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2203301,"sequence":17,"variant":0,"line_id":220330108,"next_line_ids":[220330109],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3022,"speaker_text_hash":727626069,"speaker":"汤雯","speaker_raw":"汤雯","text_hash":925789818,"text":"其实，我觉得这对我来说也算是好事。因为我感觉，此刻的稻妻正处于一个历史性的时刻！","raw_text":"其实，我觉得这对我来说也算是好事。因为我感觉，此刻的稻妻正处于一个历史性的时刻！","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2203301.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22033","main_id":22033,"main_title":"家乡之味","main_description":"来自璃月的学者汤雯似乎饱受思乡之情的困扰…","chapter_title":"家乡之味","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2203301,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2203301,"sequence":18,"variant":0,"line_id":220330109,"next_line_ids":[220330110],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3022,"speaker_text_hash":727626069,"speaker":"汤雯","speaker_raw":"汤雯","text_hash":2655530746,"text":"我很确信，这段特殊的时期，必然会在提瓦特的史册上留下浓墨重彩的一笔。","raw_text":"我很确信，这段特殊的时期，必然会在提瓦特的史册上留下浓墨重彩的一笔。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2203301.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22033","main_id":22033,"main_title":"家乡之味","main_description":"来自璃月的学者汤雯似乎饱受思乡之情的困扰…","chapter_title":"家乡之味","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2203301,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2203301,"sequence":19,"variant":0,"line_id":220330110,"next_line_ids":[220330111],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3022,"speaker_text_hash":727626069,"speaker":"汤雯","speaker_raw":"汤雯","text_hash":1164446354,"text":"亲眼见证这样的历史，然后真实、完整、清晰地将这一切记录成册，留给后人，就是历史学者所要做的事情。","raw_text":"亲眼见证这样的历史，然后真实、完整、清晰地将这一切记录成册，留给后人，就是历史学者所要做的事情。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2203301.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22033","main_id":22033,"main_title":"家乡之味","main_description":"来自璃月的学者汤雯似乎饱受思乡之情的困扰…","chapter_title":"家乡之味","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2203301,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2203301,"sequence":20,"variant":0,"line_id":220330111,"next_line_ids":[220330112],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3022,"speaker_text_hash":727626069,"speaker":"汤雯","speaker_raw":"汤雯","text_hash":2761294442,"text":"不过…虽然这样的事业很让我振奋，但它可没法满足我的肚子…","raw_text":"不过…虽然这样的事业很让我振奋，但它可没法满足我的肚子…","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2203301.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22033","main_id":22033,"main_title":"家乡之味","main_description":"来自璃月的学者汤雯似乎饱受思乡之情的困扰…","chapter_title":"家乡之味","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2203301,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2203301,"sequence":21,"variant":0,"line_id":220330112,"next_line_ids":[220330113],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speaker_id":0,"speaker_text_hash":0,"speaker":"旅行者","speaker_raw":"旅行者","text_hash":1954911954,"text":"你是饿了吗？","raw_text":"你是饿了吗？","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2203301.json"}
